502	     * Each person's open figure at the end of the date, by person id for every person on the sheet: the dues as shown
503	     * now of their claims due by a date in one of the periods that were OPEN or PENDING at the end of the date by their
504	     * status log and count then, skipping those with no due; 0.00 with none.
